      "start": 1519,
      "end": 1784,
      "bones": [
        1,
        2,
        3
      ],
      "labels": [],
      "text": "Now the cranial vault moves away to expose the cranial base. The floor has three fossae: anterior, middle, and posterior. The following markers indicate selected openings and their approximate regions.",
