        "Vomer",
        "Nasal bone (L)"
      ],
      "text": "The small facial bones include lacrimal, palatine, inferior nasal concha, vomer, and nasal bones. They contribute to the orbits, nasal cavity, nasal septum, and palate. Each has a different role; they do not all form the same wall.",
